Z||000006||Nashco||10-17-2001||10:20 PM||||I'm all for a taller stantion (or whatever it's called <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">), but not an extension.  I, ideally, would like to get a very tall set...like 12" or maybe even more.  I would like them to be all one piece, and have a slight angle built in.  The goal of all this is to make the spoiler actually functional.  I think the ideal set would mount in the stock location, have some stronger mounting method for additional forces, be at an angle to the decklid to distance the wing further back in relation to the car, and have the wing angled down in the nose a little.  That is the order of importance, as well, in my opinion.  If nothing like this is available after I get my powertrain how I want it, I will just make my own.  I would buy them before if they were available like this; dad asked me if I wanted some for Christmas.. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Hard to say no to wing risers, but I know the add-ons just wouldn't satisfy me.<P>That's my opinion on it all anyway <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
